{"product":{"id":4595426328641,"title":"ABBA CB15 Smooth Round LED Cabinet Light - Multiple Finishes\/Color Temperatures","body_html":"\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBody Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anodized Aluminum\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePower:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.5W DC 12V COB\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e-(P.D. COB= Chip On Board, new technology for the LED light engine)\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLight Color Temperature:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eWarm White 3000K OR Cool White 5000K (Dimmable LED)\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFinish:\u003c\/strong\u003e White, Black, or Silver\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize: \u003c\/strong\u003e1.75″ (Diameter) x .75″ (Depth) x 1.15″ (Cutout)\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumens: \u003c\/strong\u003e115 LM\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpgrade your cabinet or cupboard lighting fixture with this stylish, dimmable, space-saving LED recessed cabinet downlight. This novelty LED downlight is made up of anodized aluminum with 3 attractive finishes including white, black, or silver. The integrated 1.5W DC 12V COB chip LED is power saving, so it lowers a lot of your maintenance cost and electricity bill of lighting.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese dimmable LED round cabinet lights emit 115 Lumens, 3000K or 5000K temperature of warm white light which creates a pleasing atmosphere. Its size is 1.75″ (Diameter) x .75″ (Depth) x 1.15″ (Cutout).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"ABBA Lighting","product_type":"LED Cabinet Lights","created_at":"2020-10-07T11:36:56-07:00","handle":"abba-1-5w-aluminum-smooth-led-round-3000k-cabinet-light","updated_at